@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

' Definisi Partisipan
actor "Admin" as User
boundary "Halaman Laporan" as UI
control "Sistem (Backend)" as System
database "Database (Reports)" as DB
participant "MikroTik Router" as MT

' ================= FLOW 1: LAPORAN CUSTOMER =================
group Laporan Customer
    User -> UI : 1. Pilih tipe laporan & filter tanggal
    activate UI
    UI -> System : 2. GET /api/reports/customer?type={}&start={}&end={}
    deactivate UI
    activate System
    
    System -> DB : 3. Query data (customers, subscriptions, invoices)
    activate DB
    DB --> System : 4. Return raw data
    deactivate DB
    
    System -> System : 5. Aggregate & format (status aktif, total bayar, riwayat)
    System -> DB : 6. Join dengan bandwidth_profile & router
    activate DB
    DB --> System : 7. Return joined data
    deactivate DB
    
    System -> System : 8. Simpan hasil ke Cache (Redis)
    System --> UI : 9. Return {success: true, data: [...], stats: {...}}
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : 10. Tampilkan tabel & ringkasan statistik
    deactivate UI
end

' ================= FLOW 2: LAPORAN PENJUALAN HOTSPOT =================
group Laporan Penjualan Hotspot
    User -> UI : 11. Pilih periode & filter router/paket
    activate UI
    UI -> System : 12. GET /api/reports/hotspot?period={}&router_id={}
    deactivate UI
    activate System
    
    System -> DB : 13. Query (voucher_sales, hotspot_users, profiles)
    activate DB
    DB --> System : 14. Return data penjualan
    deactivate DB
    
    System -> System : 15. Aggregate (total revenue, qty, profit) & Group by tanggal
    System -> System : 16. Generate data untuk grafik (trend & top package)
    System -> DB : 17. Simpan hasil cache
    activate DB
    DB --> System : 18. Cache saved
    deactivate DB
    
    System --> UI : 19. Return {success: true, table: [...], chart: {...}}
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : 20. Tampilkan dashboard penjualan & grafik interaktif
    deactivate UI
end

' ================= FLOW 3: EXPORT & DOWNLOAD =================
group Export & Download Laporan
    User -> UI : 21. Klik Export (PDF/Excel)
    activate UI
    UI -> System : 22. POST /api/reports/export {type, format}
    deactivate UI
    activate System
    
    System -> DB : 23. Ambil dataset dari Cache/Database
    activate DB
    DB --> System : 24. Return data lengkap
    deactivate DB
    
    System -> System : 25. Render template laporan (PDF/Excel engine)
    System -> System : 26. Tambahkan metadata (tanggal, admin, watermark)
    System -> DB : 27. Catat log export (audit trail)
    activate DB
    DB --> System : 28. Log tersimpan
    deactivate DB
    
    System --> UI : 29. Return file binary / download URL
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : 30. Download file ke perangkat
    deactivate UI
end

' ================= FLOW 4: SINKRONISASI REALTIME (CRON) =================
group Sinkronisasi Data Realtime
    System -> System : 31. Trigger Cron Job (setiap 5 menit)
    System -> MT : 32. API: Ambil statistik active session & traffic
    activate MT
    MT --> System : 33. Return data real-time
    deactivate MT
    
    System -> DB : 34. Update summary laporan & status user
    activate DB
    DB --> System : 35. Update berhasil
    deactivate DB
    System -> System : 36. Refresh cache laporan
end

note right of User
  * Laporan di-cache di Redis untuk akses cepat
  * Export mendukung PDF & Excel dengan audit log
  * Cron job memastikan data selalu up-to-date
  * MikroTik menyumbang data realtime (session/traffic)
end note

@enduml